"Dedicated to the Moirai,or Fates,the marble altar appears well tended.clotho,Lachesis,and Atropos comprise the trinity which is the Moirai.each aspect has her own function with regard to the fate of men:Clotho spins the threads of life,Lachesis measures them,and Atropos cuts them,determining the life-span of an individual",
