"The hydra is not the most intelligent creature ever to walk the planet,nor is she one of the prettiest;you are unlikely to find her attending a political rally or standing atop the winners' podium at a beauty contest.when it comes to guarding gates,however,her track record is second to none.did you really think you could nonchalantly stroll up,open the gates and walk through?think again.",
"Placing one end of the reed in your mouth you find that you are able to breathe through its hollow stem quite comfortably.you look pretty stupid though.",
"For a brief moment it seems that the surface tension of the mud and slime might support your weight.alas,the moment is gone.and so have you.where the moment went is not certain.perhaps it's making its way through the four-dimensional geometry of the space-time continuum.perhaps not.your route,on the other hand,is an unshakeable absolute:You are going down.down...down...down.down to the bottom of the swamp.annoyingly it's not that deep;nine feet perhaps - three more than you unfortunately.if only the others could see you now.what an embarrassment!it'll be in all the papers tomorrow.just imagine the headlines: 'SEA-GOD DROWNS IN THREE FEET OF WATER'.yes,they're bound to exaggerate.well,it is their job.isn't it?anyway,your oxygen-starved brain can't function any longer;your nose,mouth and lungs seem to have divided a good percentage of the swamp between them;and your brief sojourn as a professional Hero - let's face it - wasn't exactly a performance to envy.",
